---
description: Used when starting to implement code from spec
alwaysApply: false
---

- New specs are written in ./docs/spec/planned/<spec_name>.md
- Start by writing the simplest possible implementation that satisfies the spec according to style.mdc.
- Refer to writing_tests.mdc for writing the tests afterwards.
- Edit any architecture or design decision in ./docs/architecture directory
- After implementation is done, move the spec file to ./docs/spec/implemented/<spec_name>.md.